["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The SpaceX IPO, Fable 5, AI Capex Update &amp; Market Check w/ Gavin Baker, Andrew Fox &amp; Clark Tang | BG2 Pareto frontier/curve EWS (Elon Web Services) ASIC two-stage reusability token router\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-06-11-bg2-没人把spacex算进ai算力竞赛-直到它一个月签下两笔巨单/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fadb1586fa86c61b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">1:20:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">BG2</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0611</span></div>\n<h2>沒人把SpaceX算進AI算力競賽，直到它一個月簽下兩筆巨單</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">過去六週裡，馬斯克把SpaceX從火箭和衛星公司，悄悄變成了排名第四的AI算力雲廠商，還沒人把這算進1.77萬億估值裡。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI算力</span><span class=\"tag\">SpaceX IPO</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Episode 196: Dominic D’Agostino discusses advances in ketogenic metabolic therapy and hyperbaric oxygen therapy ketone metabolic therapy hyperbaric oxygen therapy Glasgow Coma Scale 1,3-butanediol glucose hypometabolism\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-06-11-stemtalk-脑外伤本质是能量危机-酮体能绕过受损的葡萄糖代谢/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7070f878b7e6606f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">STEM-Talk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0611</span></div>\n<h2>腦外傷本質是能量危機，酮體能繞過受損的葡萄糖代謝</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">創傷性腦損傷後大腦先超量用糖、再長期糖代謝低下，而酮體不依賴這條受損通路，還能抑制神經炎症——這解釋了為什麼酮代謝療法能同時作用於癲癇、精神障礙和成癮。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">腦外傷</span><span class=\"tag\">酮體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"王晶×羅永浩！誰還記得大導演張徹楚原？我死了什麼都不需要留下 首部劇情電影計劃 網大\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-06-11-cn2d7912-王晶-港片衰落不是因为回归-而是1993年台湾市场崩盘/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/95375ff339622f0a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">3:25:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0611</span></div>\n<h2>王晶：港片衰落不是因為迴歸，而是1993年臺灣市場崩盤</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">港片衰落常被歸因於九七回歸後題材收緊，但王晶說真正轉折點是1993年香港電影人逼臺灣全面開放好萊塢片配額，自斷了養活港片產業的臺灣市場。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">香港電影</span><span class=\"tag\">黑幫經濟</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"This Old Repo: LLMs and the Restoration of BattleTris bit rot\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-06-09-oxideandfriend-三十年前的游戏代码复活记-llm-修老软件比写新代码更值钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f74d4221ee123cdd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Oxide and Friends</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0609</span></div>\n<h2>三十年前的遊戲代碼復活記：LLM 修老軟件比寫新代碼更值錢</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">兩個老程序員用 Claude 復活了一款 1993 年寫的對戰版俄羅斯方塊，過程中 LLM 修好了連 32 位轉 64 位都沒出現過的整數寬度 bug，診斷鏈條清晰到讓人意外。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">LLM輔助編程</span><span class=\"tag\">遺留代碼</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"告別算力焦慮！中國AI不再靠英偉達，華為做對了什麼？ KV Cache MoE CUDA CANN SIMD/SMT\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-06-08-laoshi-黄仁勋称灾难-deepseek甩开英伟达跑通万亿参数模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e5a42471a6aa9b97-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"老\"><span class=\"dur\">23:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">老石談芯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0608</span></div>\n<h2>黃仁勳稱災難：DeepSeek甩開英偉達跑通萬億參數模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DeepSeek V4在設計之初就與華為昇騰做芯片到模型的協同，成本只有國際競品的七分之一，證明算力路線不止一條。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">國產算力</span><span class=\"tag\">華為昇騰</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Elon Musk and Ian Dahl, SpaceX Vision Update, June 8, 2026 Kardashev scale TerraFab mass driver rapid reusability\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-06-08-ch-space-span-science-policy-and-news-马斯克-要把数据中心搬上太空-三年内入轨运力冲到百万吨/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bdc1e66c9a590f28-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">31:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Space SPAN (Science Policy and News)</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0608</span></div>\n<h2>馬斯克：要把數據中心搬上太空，三年內入軌運力衝到百萬噸</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Starship的快速可重複使用是太空算力躍升的前提，SpaceX計劃三年內把到軌運力從每年2500噸推到百萬噸級，為太空AI數據中心鋪路。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">SpaceX</span><span class=\"tag\">太空算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"144. 對陽萌的4小時訪談：消費電子死與生、第三類公司、端側模型、產品方法、遊戲模式 存算一體 馮諾依曼架構 N-time efficiency worker SackKit 康威定律\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-06-08-zhangxiaojun-安克做芯片-从五系到七系-一家消费电子公司的补课/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/99b672a2ad0c5ace-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:38:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0608</span></div>\n<h2>安克做芯片：從五系到七系，一家消費電子公司的補課</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">安克前11年順風順水，2022年卻發現自己建的產品線打不過外面的獨角獸。陽萌的解法不是換人，而是把公司從五系產品公司改造成七系創新公司——代價是補上第一性、求極致、共成長這套價值觀。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消費電子</span><span class=\"tag\">存算一體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Reinventing Entropy | Compression is Intelligence Part 1 prefix-free code noiseless coding theorem entropy rate cross-entropy loss\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-06-07-karpathy-压缩就是智能-预测与压缩是同一枚硬币的两面/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/911ed142cc051a24-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">32:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Andrej Karpathy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0607</span></div>\n<h2>壓縮就是智能：預測與壓縮是同一枚硬幣的兩面</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">信息論說預測和壓縮在數學上等價，所以語言模型的預訓練目標可以重新理解為造一臺最高效的文本壓縮器，而不只是預測下一個 token。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">信息論</span><span class=\"tag\">壓縮</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang &amp; Dell CEO Michael Dell on Agentic AI, Memory Demand and China |... harness agentic AI AI factory physical AI\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-06-01-ch-bloomberg-podcasts-ai-算力瓶颈不再是-gpu-黄仁勋说是内存/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/915a917b58e6e5bf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">20:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Bloomberg Podcasts</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0601</span></div>\n<h2>AI 算力瓶頸不再是 GPU,黃仁勳說是內存</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黃仁勳說三年前就已經把未來的內存需求曲線講給美光和SK海力士聽，這次供應緊張不是歷史週期性的內存漲跌，而是AI算力結構性變化的結果。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力供應鏈</span><span class=\"tag\">內存</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"JUST RECORDED: Elon Musk Interviewed by JP Morgan&#x27;s Jamie Dimon rail gun / mass driver TerraFab\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-06-01-ch-brighter-with-herbert-spacex上市不缺钱-是为了造十万颗卫星和太空数据中心/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5a79e32a33f2acea-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">21:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Brighter with Herbert</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0601</span></div>\n<h2>SpaceX上市不缺錢，是為了造十萬顆衛星和太空數據中心</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">馬斯克說SpaceX早在2014、2015年就現金流為正、根本不缺錢，這次上市是為了給超10萬顆V3衛星和太空AI數據中心的鉅額資本開支融資。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">太空產業</span><span class=\"tag\">衛星通信</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Nvidia’s Jensen Huang on the AI revolution, job losses and what drives him | Full interview five-layer cake agentic AI wabi-sabi\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-06-01-ch-cna-你不会被ai取代-而是被更会用ai的人取代/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7f589adb2af3b47f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">56:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">CNA</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0601</span></div>\n<h2>你不會被AI取代，而是被更會用AI的人取代</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黃仁勳以放射科為例反駁失業論：AI被預測最先淘汰放射科醫生，結果這個崗位的人數、薪資反而雙雙上漲。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI就業影響</span><span class=\"tag\">中美科技競爭</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"LIVE: Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang speaks at Computex harness KV caching Mixture of Experts (MoE) DPU tokens per watt\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-06-01-ch-reuters-过去cpu是为人类造的-英伟达说智能体需要完全不同的cpu/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c79e5a115e3c337e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">2:06:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Reuters</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0601</span></div>\n<h2>過去CPU是為人類造的，英偉達說智能體需要完全不同的CPU</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">智能體按納秒計時、舊CPU按秒出租邏輯設計，英偉達為此造了全新架構的Vera CPU，稱這會是比舊CPU市場更大的新市場。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI基礎設施</span><span class=\"tag\">智能體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"NVIDIA&#x27;s Jensen Huang on Building the Dynamo of the Intelligence Age Dynamo agentic AI tokens\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-06-01-ch-sequoia-capital-黄仁勋-你不会输给ai-会输给会用ai的人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aea229243f5dcf5f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">41:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Sequoia Capital</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0601</span></div>\n<h2>黃仁勳：你不會輸給AI，會輸給會用AI的人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黃仁勳用「放射科醫生被預言淘汰十二年後人數反而更多」反駁AI消滅崗位論——自動化提升的是任務效率，不是職業本身，崗位的「目的」始終需要人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI基礎設施</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"266: If ADHD Medication Doesn’t Help Kids Learn, What Does? MTA study crossover design DSM misrecognition\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-06-01-parentmojo-adhd-药物改得了行为-改不了学习/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">30:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0601</span></div>\n<h2>ADHD 藥物改得了行為，改不了學習</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Barkley 把 ADHD 比作糖尿病，但 64% 的人會反覆移出診斷標準；藥物提高服從性卻不改善學習，MTA 長期隨訪證實無學業優勢，真正有效的是小班差異化教學。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">ADHD</span><span class=\"tag\">兒童教育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Toast: Sticky SaaS - [Business Breakdowns, EP.247] net take rate SaaSpocalypse TAM MOIC flywheel market\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-05-29-breakdowns-行业15-的年流失率-反而成了toast抢份额的武器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f5791491c49c13a7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">49:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Business Breakdowns</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0529</span></div>\n<h2>行業15%的年流失率，反而成了Toast搶份額的武器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">每年有10萬到12萬家美國餐廳倒閉又重開，高流失率原本該是壞消息，卻給了Toast這個挑戰者源源不斷的新客戶入口，它靠產品優勢正拿下其中約一半的新開業餐廳。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">垂直SaaS</span><span class=\"tag\">支付處理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"羅永浩的X字路口！當一群情緒不穩定的槓精討論起情緒穩定 POA\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-05-29-cn2d7912-对方朝车窗吐痰泄愤-他说这证明自己更幸福/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e575a124b5b62c2b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">2:33:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0529</span></div>\n<h2>對方朝車窗吐痰洩憤，他說這證明自己更幸福</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">「幸福者退讓原則」是說：衝突時先判斷誰更幸福，幸福的一方才該讓——這套邏輯把躲在車裡不還手，包裝成了理性而不是害怕對方人高馬大。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">情緒管理</span><span class=\"tag\">脫口秀</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"143. 對何小鵬的第二次訪談：更大賭注、人形機器人Iron誕生、那場意外、技術劇變下CEO、GX和縫合怪 VLA 縫合怪 SOP T1\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-05-28-zhangxiaojun-何小鹏-通用人形机器人99-99-会死-我们赌那两成胜率/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/392e7ab9c3c64df9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:28:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0528</span></div>\n<h2>何小鵬：通用人形機器人99.99%會死，我們賭那兩成勝率</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小鵬把花了小几十億的自動駕駛體系整個停掉，因為用軟件方法論加AI工具箱做出來的只是「AI縫合怪」。他給通用人形機器人的勝率是兩成，而機器人創業難度是造車的20到100倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人形機器人</span><span class=\"tag\">自動駕駛</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"142. 雨森的創投觀察第2集：Harness、下一個字節、2026大機會和Stanley Druckenmiller Harness context engineering sandbox out of distribution agency\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-05-27-zhangxiaojun-harness-才是操作系统-模型只是插拔的处理器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/38abc82541e9f530-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:18:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0527</span></div>\n<h2>Harness 才是操作系統，模型只是插拔的處理器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型公司做的是提煉基礎油的煉油廠，真正值錢的是化工廠和汽車公司。用戶對 Harness 更忠誠——他會換模型，但不想換掉存著自己記憶的那個殼。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 應用</span><span class=\"tag\">Harness</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Episode 195: Doug Cooke discusses NASA’s challenges in the space race to the Moon and Mars EDL (Entry, Descent, and Landing) cryogenic fuel transfer new space / commercial\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-05-21-stemtalk-nasa前高管-当前登月方案过于复杂-2028年根本无法实现/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/40c94fa1d0f627de-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">58:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">STEM-Talk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0521</span></div>\n<h2>NASA前高管：當前登月方案過於複雜，2028年根本無法實現</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">道格·庫克認為，登月艙依賴未經驗證的低溫推進劑在軌轉移與細高塔式結構，讓任務成功率層層打折，中國的簡化方案反而更可能先登月。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">航天</span><span class=\"tag\">NASA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"鄭執×羅永浩！總是趕末班車的人，可以改進時間管理......也可以擁有一輛屬於自己的車 匿名作家計劃 萬畝大造林\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-05-21-cn2d7912-三到五年内-ai将让零资源新导演和资深导演站在同一起跑线/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c21e5eeeb2a439b8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">2:39:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0521</span></div>\n<h2>三到五年內，AI將讓零資源新導演和資深導演站在同一起跑線</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">鄭執說電影創作資源曾是有和沒有之間零和一百的關係，但AI使實拍成本指數級下降後，沒資源的窮小子和功成名就的導演會站在同一個起跑線上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">東北文藝復興</span><span class=\"tag\">導演處女作</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Vanguard ETF mutualization 2&amp;20 / carry sales load\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-05-18-acquired-放弃全部利润-vanguard把自己做成了无法复制的对手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b271b26bce642e3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">3:48:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Acquired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0518</span></div>\n<h2>放棄全部利潤，Vanguard把自己做成了無法複製的對手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Vanguard的護城河不是規模或品牌，而是一個經濟學悖論：想複製它的對手要麼保留利潤、放棄價格競爭力，要麼降到零利潤、無法持續運營。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">指數基金</span><span class=\"tag\">被動投資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"141. Freda的投資札記第2集：Tokenmaxxing、把電機塞進蒸汽機、接力賽變籃球賽、孤獨、人的連接 Tokenmaxxing recursive self-improvement economic diffusion Neo Labs Acquire Hire\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-05-18-zhangxiaojun-ai-时代最稀缺的不是信息-是有人味的对话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/86731af431732da4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:23:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0518</span></div>\n<h2>AI 時代最稀缺的不是信息，是有人味的對話</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">當 90% 到 95% 的信息性內容都能直接問 AI 拿到，以信息交換為目的的對話正在被掏空，人和人之間剩下的只有情感連接。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>17</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI投資</span><span class=\"tag\">模型公司</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"李想×羅永浩！李想的理想：通過 AI 技術，讓普通人也過上富豪的生活 具身智能 VLA 線控底盤 動態數據流架構\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-05-13-cn2d7912-理想要把富豪才有的司机管家生活卖给普通人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/37ee0608f621bf45-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">2:20:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0513</span></div>\n<h2>理想要把富豪才有的司機管家生活賣給普通人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">李想判斷，十年後買L4自動駕駛車和買家用機器人的會是同一批人——AI的價值不是替代工作，而是把富豪才僱得起的司機和管家，變成普通家庭也能消費的服務。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">自動駕駛</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"140. 對姚順宇的4小時訪談：請允許我小瘋一下！在Anthropic和Gemini訓模型、技術預測、英雄主義已過去 scaling law reward signal multi-agent VLA context management continual learning\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-05-11-zhangxiaojun-ai-是浪-冲浪的人不重要-模型大厂研究员的自白/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dddeb887e7c6825c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:50:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0511</span></div>\n<h2>AI 是浪，衝浪的人不重要：模型大廠研究員的自白</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">預訓練沒有到頭，撞牆的人多半是自己有 bug；AI 本質是簡單的，因為它能做實驗。個人英雄主義時代已經過去，現在拼的是組織系統性和靠譜。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">模型訓練</span><span class=\"tag\">組織管理</span>\n</div></div></a>"]